                                                                                
 Usage: opentide lsp [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                
                                                                                
 Serve the language server for editors                                          
                                                                                
 The server is the analysis engine that pip install opentide installs: KQL,     
 SPL, ES|QL, EQL, Kibana KQL, Lucene and Tide YAML. The editor owns the process 
 and speaks the protocol on stdio. On the command line, opentide validate and   
 opentide lint report what it finds.                                            
                                                                                
